{
  "info": {
    "name": "Integración Orion Ofima",
    "description": "Colección para probar la integración documentada en DOCUMENTACION_INTEGRACION_ORION_OFIMA_PEDIDOS.html.\n\n1. Completa las variables usuario y password.\n2. Ejecuta Login (JWT). El token se guarda solo en la variable token.\n3. Prueba clientes, productos, inventario y bodegas contra Orion.\n\nbase_orion por defecto apunta a pruebas (developer). Para producción cámbiala a https://app.orioncrm.com.co/softjm",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_orion", "value": "https://developer.orioncrm.com.co/softjm" },
    { "key": "usuario", "value": "" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "id_empresa", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "ofima_url_clientes", "value": "https://api.ofima.com/integracion/orion/clientes" },
    { "key": "ofima_url_productos", "value": "https://api.ofima.com/integracion/orion/productos" },
    { "key": "ofima_url_pedidos", "value": "https://api.ofima.com/integracion/orion/pedidos" },
    { "key": "ofima_usuario", "value": "" },
    { "key": "ofima_password", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Ofima hacia Orion",
      "description": "Endpoints que Orion expone. Auth: Bearer JWT obtenido en Login, o Basic Auth.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login JWT",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (json.token) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                { "key": "username", "value": "{{usuario}}", "type": "string" },
                { "key": "password", "value": "{{password}}", "type": "string" }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"usuario\": \"{{usuario}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"id_empresa\": {{id_empresa}}\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{base_orion}}/usuarios/api/orion/auth.php",
            "description": "POST /softjm/usuarios/api/orion/auth.php\nBasic Auth o body JSON con usuario y password. Guarda token para el resto de peticiones."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Clientes",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"identificacion\": \"900123456-1\",\n  \"tipodcto\": \"N\",\n  \"nombre\": \"Cliente Ejemplo S.A.S\",\n  \"email\": \"contacto@ejemplo.com\",\n  \"telefono\": \"6011234567\",\n  \"direccion\": \"Calle 123\",\n  \"ciudad\": \"05001\",\n  \"celular\": \"3001234567\",\n  \"referencia\": \"\",\n  \"id_empresa\": {{id_empresa}}\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{base_orion}}/usuarios/api/orion/clientes-recibir.php",
            "description": "POST /softjm/usuarios/api/orion/clientes-recibir.php. Requeridos: identificacion, nombre. ciudad = código DIAN (ciu_cod_dian, ej. 05001 o 11001). NO enviar el nombre de la ciudad (ej. Bogotá). Orion homologa a ciu_id y cli_zona."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Productos",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"referencia\": \"COD001\",\n  \"nombre\": \"Producto ejemplo\",\n  \"costo\": 10000,\n  \"utilidad\": 30,\n  \"precio\": 13000,\n  \"linea\": \"001\",\n  \"sublinea\": \"010\",\n  \"grupo\": \"MAR01\",\n  \"clasificacion_1\": \"034\",\n  \"grupo_id\": \"001\",\n  \"categoria_id\": \"010\",\n  \"marca_id\": \"MAR01\",\n  \"proveedor_id\": null,\n  \"descripcion_corta\": \"\",\n  \"descripcion_larga\": \"\",\n  \"descuento1\": null,\n  \"comision\": null,\n  \"costo_dolar\": null,\n  \"habilitado\": 1,\n  \"id_empresa\": {{id_empresa}}\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{base_orion}}/usuarios/api/orion/productos-recibir.php",
            "description": "Ofima→Orion. linea/sublinea/grupo (o grupo_id/categoria_id/marca_id) = códigos Ofima; Orion los resuelve a catp_id/mar_id y guarda IDs internos en prod_grupo1/prod_categoria/prod_marca. No persiste el código."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Inventario un item",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"referencia\": \"COD001\",\n  \"bodega_referencia\": \"BOGOTA\",\n  \"existencias\": 50,\n  \"id_empresa\": {{id_empresa}}\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{base_orion}}/usuarios/api/orion/inventario-recibir.php",
            "description": "POST /softjm/usuarios/api/orion/inventario-recibir.php. Un solo ítem."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Inventario lote",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"id_empresa\": {{id_empresa}},\n  \"items\": [\n    { \"referencia\": \"COD001\", \"bodega_referencia\": \"BOGOTA\", \"existencias\": 50 },\n    { \"referencia\": \"COD002\", \"bodega_referencia\": \"BOGOTA\", \"existencias\": 30 }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{base_orion}}/usuarios/api/orion/inventario-recibir.php",
            "description": "POST /softjm/usuarios/api/orion/inventario-recibir.php. Varios ítems en items."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Bodegas",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"referencia\": \"BOGOTA\",\n  \"nombre\": \"BODEGA BOGOTÁ\",\n  \"ciudad\": \"11001\",\n  \"id_empresa\": {{id_empresa}}\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{base_orion}}/usuarios/api/orion/bodegas-recibir.php",
            "description": "POST /softjm/usuarios/api/orion/bodegas-recibir.php. ciudad es el código DIAN (ciu_cod_dian). La bodega queda habilitada."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Orion hacia Ofima",
      "description": "Ejemplos de lo que Orion envía a las URLs que Ofima debe exponer. Auth: HTTP Basic.",
      "auth": {
        "type": "basic",
        "basic": [
          { "key": "username", "value": "{{ofima_usuario}}", "type": "string" },
          { "key": "password", "value": "{{ofima_password}}", "type": "string" }
        ]
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Clientes crear",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"identificacion\": \"900123456-1\",\n  \"tipodcto\": \"N\",\n  \"nombre\": \"Cliente Ejemplo S.A.S\",\n  \"email\": \"contacto@ejemplo.com\",\n  \"telefono\": \"6011234567\",\n  \"direccion\": \"Calle 123\",\n  \"ciudad\": \"05001\",\n  \"celular\": \"3001234567\",\n  \"referencia\": \"\",\n  \"id_empresa\": {{id_empresa}}\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{ofima_url_clientes}}",
            "description": "Orion → Ofima. ciudad = código DIAN (ciu_cod_dian, ej. 05001), NO el nombre de la ciudad."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Clientes actualizar",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"identificacion\": \"900123456-1\",\n  \"tipodcto\": \"N\",\n  \"nombre\": \"Cliente Ejemplo S.A.S\",\n  \"email\": \"contacto@ejemplo.com\",\n  \"telefono\": \"6011234567\",\n  \"direccion\": \"Calle 123\",\n  \"ciudad\": \"05001\",\n  \"celular\": \"3001234567\",\n  \"referencia\": \"\",\n  \"id_empresa\": {{id_empresa}}\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{ofima_url_clientes}}",
            "description": "Orion → Ofima. ciudad = código DIAN (ciu_cod_dian, ej. 05001), NO el nombre de la ciudad."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Productos crear",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "[\n  {\n    \"referencia\": \"60\",\n    \"nombre\": \"Prueba\",\n    \"costo\": 0,\n    \"utilidad\": 30,\n    \"precio\": 100,\n    \"categoria_id\": \"010\",\n    \"grupo_id\": \"001\",\n    \"marca_id\": \"MAR01\",\n    \"grupo\": \"MAR01\",\n    \"proveedor_id\": 0,\n    \"descripcion_corta\": \"Prueba\",\n    \"descripcion_larga\": \"Prueba\",\n    \"descuento1\": 0,\n    \"comision\": 0,\n    \"costo_dolar\": 0,\n    \"id_empresa\": {{id_empresa}},\n    \"grupo_1\": \"001\",\n    \"linea\": \"001\",\n    \"grupo_2\": \"010\",\n    \"sublinea\": \"010\",\n    \"grupo_3\": \"034\",\n    \"clasificacion_1\": \"034\",\n    \"habilitado\": 1\n  }\n]",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{ofima_url_productos}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Productos actualizar",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "[\n  {\n    \"referencia\": \"60\",\n    \"nombre\": \"Prueba\",\n    \"costo\": 0,\n    \"utilidad\": 30,\n    \"precio\": 100,\n    \"categoria_id\": \"010\",\n    \"grupo_id\": \"001\",\n    \"marca_id\": \"MAR01\",\n    \"grupo\": \"MAR01\",\n    \"proveedor_id\": 0,\n    \"descripcion_corta\": \"Prueba\",\n    \"descripcion_larga\": \"Prueba\",\n    \"descuento1\": 0,\n    \"comision\": 0,\n    \"costo_dolar\": 0,\n    \"id_empresa\": {{id_empresa}},\n    \"grupo_1\": \"001\",\n    \"linea\": \"001\",\n    \"grupo_2\": \"010\",\n    \"sublinea\": \"010\",\n    \"grupo_3\": \"034\",\n    \"clasificacion_1\": \"034\",\n    \"habilitado\": 1\n  }\n]",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{ofima_url_productos}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Pedidos crear",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"numero\": \"123\",\n  \"cliente_identificacion\": \"900123456-1\",\n  \"cliente_id\": 5,\n  \"fecha\": \"2025-02-26\",\n  \"observaciones\": \"Texto opcional\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"referencia\": \"COD001\",\n      \"producto_id\": 10,\n      \"cantidad\": 2,\n      \"valor\": 15000.00,\n      \"descuento\": 0,\n      \"impuesto\": 19\n    }\n  ],\n  \"id_empresa\": {{id_empresa}}\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{ofima_url_pedidos}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Pedidos actualizar",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"numero\": \"123\",\n  \"cliente_identificacion\": \"900123456-1\",\n  \"cliente_id\": 5,\n  \"fecha\": \"2025-02-26\",\n  \"observaciones\": \"Texto opcional\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"referencia\": \"COD001\",\n      \"producto_id\": 10,\n      \"cantidad\": 2,\n      \"valor\": 15000.00,\n      \"descuento\": 0,\n      \"impuesto\": 19\n    }\n  ],\n  \"id_empresa\": {{id_empresa}}\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{ofima_url_pedidos}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
